<view class="root-page history-page">
  <view class="root-card">
    <view class="eyebrow">7日进度</view>
    <view class="h1">7天记录</view>
    <view class="root-helper-text">这些记录会成为最终免单审核和身体趋势总结的依据。页面只呈现真实反馈，不把身体感受包装成成绩单。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section root-card history-list">
    <view wx:if="{{records.length}}">
      <view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="dayIndex" class="list-item history-row" data-day="{{item.dayIndex}}" bindtap="select">
        <view class="row-marker {{item.checkedIn ? 'done' : ''}}">{{item.marker}}</view>
        <view class="history-row-content">
          <view class="row-title">{{item.title}} · {{item.date}}</view>
          <view class="history-summary">{{item.summary}}{{item.isMakeup ? ' · 补卡' : ''}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="row-pill {{item.checkedIn ? 'done' : ''}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="empty-state">
      <view class="empty-title">还没有记录</view>
      <view class="root-helper-text">开始打卡后，这里会保留每天的真实反馈。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{selected}}" class="section root-card history-detail">
    <view class="section-title">{{selected.title}} 详情</view>
    <view class="root-helper-text detail-date">{{selected.date}} · {{selected.statusText}}</view>
    <view wx:for="{{selected.detailRows}}" wx:key="label" class="detail-row {{item.long ? 'detail-row--long' : ''}}">
      <view class="detail-label">{{item.label}}</view>
      <view class="detail-value">{{item.value}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
